			(property "Description" "Toshiba TORX147(F,T) TOSLINK optical receiver, digital audio (JEITA CP-1212). Vcc=2.7-3.6V (typ 3.0V) - runs directly off +3V3_118, no separate 5V rail needed (unlike the TORX173/5V family). Pin1=Output (TTL digital, feed AK4118 RX0 via 470R series R per AK4118 datasheet Fig.22), Pin2=GND, Pin3=Vcc. Panel-mount type with self-tapping screw hole (not modeled in footprint)."
